sequenceDiagram
    participant Client as User Client
    participant WebRTCSvc as WebRTC Service
    participant VADSvc as VAD Service
    participant STTSvc as STT Service
    participant OrchSvc as Orchestrator Service
    participant TurnRepo as Turn Repository

    Note over VADSvc: State machine states:<br/>Silence → Potential → Active → Trailing

    loop During live voice call
        Client->>WebRTCSvc: Audio chunk (20ms frame)
        WebRTCSvc->>VADSvc: Forward audio frame

        VADSvc->>VADSvc: Classify frame
        Note over VADSvc: Use WebRTC VAD<br/>or Silero VAD

        alt State: Silence
            Note over VADSvc: No speech detected<br/>Buffering disabled
        end

        alt State: Potential Speech
            Note over VADSvc: Short burst detected<br/>Start buffering
        end

        alt State: Active Speech
            Note over VADSvc: Confirmed speech<br/>Buffer & forward to STT

            VADSvc->>STTSvc: Signal speech start
            VADSvc->>STTSvc: Stream audio buffers

            Note over STTSvc: Real-time transcription

            STTSvc-->>OrchSvc: Partial transcripts
        end

        alt State: Trailing Silence
            Note over VADSvc: Silence > threshold (300ms)<br/>Speech ended

            VADSvc->>STTSvc: Signal speech end
            STTSvc-->>OrchSvc: Final transcription + timing

            OrchSvc->>TurnRepo: Create Turn<br/>{text, audio ref}

            Note over VADSvc: Return to Silence state
        end
    end

    Note over VADSvc: Reduces STT processing<br/>and latency by only<br/>transcribing speech